CADCraft's icons, drafting font, hatch patterns and linetypes are drawn or defined in code.
The UI also bundles the egui font inputs described below. The per-file list is in ATTRIBUTION.md.
Builds made with the optional craft-fonts input (CRAFT_FONTS_DIR) embed the fonts listed in its
ATTRIBUTION.md, each under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

